a^4 b^4 = \frac{11 \times 10 \times 9 \times 8}{6 \times 5 \times 4 \times 3} = \frac{11 \times (2 \times 5) \times (3 \times 3) \times (2 \times 4)}{(2 \times 3) \times 5 \times 4 \times 3} = 11 \times 2 = 22

